OL,3,GNEWSAHarry and Meghan in Nottingham in
OL,4,Afirst joint engagement since UK return
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex have
OL,7,Farrived in Nottingham to cheers from a
OL,8,Fcrowd of hundreds on their first
OL,9,Froyal-style joint engagement since
OL,10,Freturning to the UK
OL,12,FThe first stop is outside the Community
OL,13,FRecording Studio (CRS) charity, a place
OL,14,FHarry has a long relationship with,
OL,15,Fbefore the couple visit two more
OL,16,Flocations
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
